# Android project.
#
# android/termux-app-fork and android/termux-app-fork-x86_64 ARE tracked: the
# GitHub Actions workflow .github/workflows/android-apk.yml builds them, so the
# source must be in the repository. The older android/ project (Phase 1/2,
# proot-distro + rootfs) stays excluded.
#
# NOTE: the re-include rules for these two projects live at the END of this
# file. Git evaluates patterns in order and does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so negations must come after every broad rule that would match
# (pencarimovie*, *.zip, *.jks).
android/*

